<title>USA: CCC seeks 6,750 T U.S. spring wheat for Honduras.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks 6,750 T U.S. spring wheat for Honduras.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it was seeking up to 6,750 tonnes of Northern Spring/Dark Northern Spring wheat for export to Honduras.</p>
<p>The shipment period was set for July 10-August 5.</p>
<p>The CCC, which is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said offers were due June 24.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
